      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kutulizaho Vifananyi kandi Vaporofeti Vuvugadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova Wuvunyali avoora, “Lwi ing'inga yeyo iduuka, Kisenukiru kilakunulwa nu kutakasa visukululwi via Daudi harara na vandu va Jerusalemi kutura ku vwoni vwavo kandi kusigamira vifananyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ing'inga yeyo, ndakatuliziho amita gi vifananyi viosi kutura ku kivala, kandi mundu kali mulala si alakavizulizi kandi mba. Ndakatuliziho mundu woosi ovola aveeye muporofeti, kandi ndakatuliziho liegomba liu kusigamira vifananyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niiva mundu woosi alazizagilira koporofeta, baba weve na mama weve valamwiganihiza ndi ivi siulava mwoyo mba, kigira ovola makuva gu vugadi mu lieta lia Yahova. Niiva si alahulira lieganihiza yili, baba weve na mama weve vamwivula valamutoza nu kumwita lwava naporofetaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lidiku liene yilio, vuli muporofeti aladuuka mu zisoni na malola geege lwava naporofetaa. Muporofeti sialiviika inguvu yu vwoya yu voporofeti kunangwa aduuki kugaada vandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa alavoora, ‘Inzi si mbeeye muporofeti mba. Mbeeye vuzwa mulimi. Ndaamenya mu mulimi kutura mu vosooleri vwange.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku niiva mundu alamuteeva, ‘Zimbala ziveeye ku muviri gugwo yizi zianyooleka ndi?’ Naye alativula, ‘Zimbala yizi ndaazinyoola mu nyumba yu mulina wange.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lilaga Kwita Mwayi wa Nyasaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova Wuvunyali avoora, “O, kivavi, vuka ulwaane mwayi wange! Oveeye ahimbi ni Inzi! Kuya mwayi uyu, na magondi galasalanywa. Inzi ndalwaana vimeme viago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avandu viduma viviri ku vivaga mu kivala choosi valitwa, ni kiduma kilala ku vivaga kilatigala mwoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakagerizi kiduma chakavaga kilihononoka, kandi ndavatakase kuli ifeza isiyangwa mu kisambiru chu muliru. Ndavagerizi kuli izahabu isiyangwa mu kisambiru chu muliru. Maku valakasaale ku inzi, na inzi ndakavativuliri. Ndakavavoolere ndi vaveeye avandu vange, navo valakiyame ndi inzi mbeeye Nyasaye wavo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
